Hi,

you can use the fluidRow  <http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/fluidPage.html>and column  <http://shiny.rstudio.com/reference/shiny/latest/column.html>functions to put the ? next to the slider, see the layout guide <http://shiny.rstudio.com/articles/layout-guide.html> for details. If you want to use tooltips etc you can use the shinyBS package <https://github.com/ebailey78/shinyBS>, see here  <http://spark.rstudio.com/johnharrison/shinyBS-Demo/>for a demo.

 best Herman

