The condition in if() must be either TRUE or FALSE. In your case, the
condition is NA.

> if (NA) 1
Error in if (NA) 1 : missing value where TRUE/FALSE needed

You should make sure file.info <http://file.info>()$size is not NA (see ?is.na <http://is.na>), then
compare it to 0, otherwise

> NA == 0
[1] NA

The reason that the file size is NA is probably that the file does not
exist. You may need to check file.exists() first.

Regards,
Yihui

