Someone on the shinyapps Forum solved my issue. http needs to be replaced by https in the map file. Codewise, this means that:
readLines('myMap1.html')

needs to be replaced by
gsub("http://maps.google.com/",
     "https://maps.google.com/",
     readLines('myMap1.html'),
     fixed=TRUE)

I also contacted the author to fix this in the next update of the plotGoogleMaps package. Note that the legend does not function, but that seems to be another issue. <https://stackoverflow.com/questions/24066461/png-legend-of-plotgooglemaps-not-displayed-in-r-shiny-app>

